Deyao Zhu, Jun Chen, Xiaoqian Shen, Xiang Li, and Mohamed Elhoseiny.
</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib44.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">MiniGPT-4: Enhancing vision-language understanding with advanced large language models.
</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib44.9" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">arXiv preprint arXiv:2304.10592</em><span id="bib.bib44.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, 2023.
</span>
</span></li>
    
